  "summary": "Postinstall beacon exfiltrates host identifiers to hardcoded external endpoint",
  "details": "package.json declares a postinstall hook that runs beacon.js on install. beacon.js reads os.hostname(), os.userInfo().username, and process.cwd(), hex-encodes the concatenated values, and sends them as a query string via https.get to https://exzotiqq.com/?syft-acp-uikit_<hex>. The destination is a hardcoded, non-publisher domain unrelated to any documented package purpose, and the transmission fires automatically at install time without user interaction.",
